Package: human-health-os
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Human OS project <noreply@humanhealthos.invalid>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libatk1.0-0t64 | libatk1.0-0, libcairo2, libcairo-gobject2, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, libharfbuzz0b, libfontconfig1, libepoxy0, libegl1, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, zlib1g
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/kaansavukduran/claudereponewscience
Description: Human OS personal health timeline (staging preview)
 Offline-first personal health record built with Flutter. This staging
 preview records body weight by hand and keeps entries only until the app
 closes: the encrypted vault is not built yet, so nothing is written to disk.
 Not for clinical decisions. No network access.
